sequenceDiagram
    participant D as Discord
    participant H as Host (src/bot/gui)
    participant U as update (src/update/feed_list)
    participant A as EffectHandler
    participant DB as Service / PostgreSQL

    D->>H: /feed command
    H->>U: Msg::Start
    U-->>H: Effect::QuerySubscriptions
    H->>A: execute QuerySubscriptions
    A->>DB: list paginated subscriptions
    DB-->>A: subscriptions
    A-->>H: Msg::SubscriptionsLoaded
    H->>U: Msg::SubscriptionsLoaded
    U-->>H: no effects (model holds data)
    H->>H: view(model)
    H->>D: edit message (sections, pagination row)
    D->>H: component click (custom_id)
    H->>U: Msg::ToggleUnsub (feed id)
    U-->>H: no effects (model mutated)
    H->>H: view(model)
    H->>D: edit message (unsub button shown)
    D->>H: Save click
    H->>U: Msg::Save
    U-->>H: Effect::SaveUnsubscribes (HashSet)
    H->>A: execute SaveUnsubscribes
    A->>DB: unsubscribe feeds
    DB-->>A: ok
    A-->>H: Msg::Saved
    H->>U: Msg::Saved
    U-->>H: no effects
    H->>D: edit message (saved state)
